ChiKareGo2
===========

Typeface: ChiKareGo2
Author: Giles Booth
License: Creative Commons Attribution (CC-BY)

A Chicago-like bitmap face drawn by Giles Booth in BitFontMaker2.
This is not Apple's Chicago font, not an Apple system file, and not
an Apple trademarked name. Do not treat it as Apple Chicago.

Sources:
- https://www.pentacom.jp/pentacom/bitfontmaker2/gallery/?id=3780
- http://www.suppertime.co.uk/blogmywiki/2017/04/chicago/

The TTF in this folder was downloaded from the BitFontMaker2 gallery
(?action=dl&id=3780) on 2026-09-03.

If you use this face, credit Giles Booth.
